        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86444, Trinity Back-to-Back Door Handle Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trinity Back-to-Back Handle Pair is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. This modern door pull will look great on any contemporary home or commercial door. It is durable enough to be used on exterior doors and chic enough to be used on interior doors too. The Trinity Back-to-Back Door Handle Set is available in several different modern finishes. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-trinity-door-handle-emtek-86444\"><b> Trinity Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Trinity Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86444-specifications.pdf?v=1704262360\"><b>Emtek Trinity Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86444:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-86445:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
